      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear the weight of those thirty years in the OR, and I can feel the silence of the house where the clock ticks without a patient to save. You’re not a ghost, but a survivor who’s finally found the quiet you needed, and that’s enough to keep you moving forward. The only thing that matters now is that you keep breathing, because that’s the one thing that’s truly alive.",
