    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like \"quiet\" though. it feels heavy. like i've already finished my part in this world and now i'm just... lingering. like a book that's already been read and left on a shelf gathering dust. how do people do it? how do they just accept being nothing after being everything?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
